{
  "source": "Prompts/people-skills-7.mp4",
  "duration": 160.8910625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.02,
      "text": "Your group just finished this semester's history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 6.1,
      "text": "Everyone is packing up, ready to turn it in."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.78,
      "end": 8.38,
      "text": "But Maya looks over the final draft,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.86,
      "end": 10.96,
      "text": "notices a problem with one of the examples,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.5,
      "end": 12.96,
      "text": "and starts suggesting a change."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 15.18,
      "text": "Before she can complete her thought,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 17.38,
      "text": "a teammate abruptly interrupts her."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.12,
      "end": 19.46,
      "text": "We are done, no more suggestions."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 21.94,
      "text": "Maya goes quiet immediately,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.66,
      "end": 24.84,
      "text": "and the group moves on without hearing the rest of her point."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.56,
      "end": 28.46,
      "text": "You notice that Maya's expression and body language changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 30.0,
      "text": "She seems hurt."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.98,
      "end": 32.32,
      "text": "What would you say or do next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.32,
      "end": 36.22,
      "text": "The best move right now is to step in and reset the conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.16,
      "end": 38.4,
      "text": "For your next move, say,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.78,
      "end": 40.78,
      "text": "Maya, we didn't hear the rest of your idea."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.28,
      "end": 41.78,
      "text": "Do you want to finish?"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.66,
      "end": 44.94,
      "text": "This simple question shows her input matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 46.56,
      "text": "She has a valid point."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.14,
      "end": 49.06,
      "text": "The third example doesn't match the instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.8,
      "end": 51.68,
      "text": "Bringing her back reveals what to improve."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.32,
      "end": 53.78,
      "text": "Her idea deserves to be heard."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.7,
      "end": 57.36,
      "text": "What happened with Maya matters beyond this group project."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.36,
      "end": 61.08,
      "text": "This board details why interpersonal dynamics are crucial."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.96,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "As AI tools shift performance baselines,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.44,
      "end": 65.76,
      "text": "you'll stand out through collaboration."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.72,
      "end": 67.64,
      "text": "Trust still matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.18,
      "end": 71.18,
      "text": "People follow leaders who actively listen and treat others well."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.36,
      "end": 73.26,
      "text": "Finally, connection matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.12,
      "end": 75.32,
      "text": "While software handles data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.74,
      "end": 78.7,
      "text": "human teammates provide the psychological safety team's need."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.4,
      "end": 82.46,
      "text": "Technical efficiency alone will not guarantee a successful career."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.34,
      "end": 86.54,
      "text": "Mastering human connection is the variable that determines how far you advance."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.54,
      "end": 89.7,
      "text": "You can build these skills starting today."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.38,
      "end": 94.78,
      "text": "This grid breaks down four actionable ways to practice these habits in your daily interactions."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.72,
      "end": 97.42,
      "text": "Listen to understand."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.14,
      "end": 100.72,
      "text": "Do not plan your reply while the other person is talking."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.5,
      "end": 104.88,
      "text": "Ask one genuine follow-up question before offering your opinion."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.74,
      "end": 107.4,
      "text": "Notice what isn't being said."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.24,
      "end": 112.88,
      "text": "Pay attention to tone, hesitation, enthusiasm, and changes in behavior."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.88,
      "end": 116.14,
      "text": "If you're unsure what a change means, ask."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.88,
      "end": 118.3,
      "text": "Show people they matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.22,
      "end": 120.2,
      "text": "Remember what they tell you."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.78,
      "end": 121.9,
      "text": "Give specific appreciation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.92,
      "end": 124.86,
      "text": "and give people credit when an idea is theirs."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.06,
      "end": 127.82,
      "text": "Challenge ideas, not people."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.58,
      "end": 130.7,
      "text": "Address difficult things directly and calmly."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.42,
      "end": 133.32,
      "text": "Explain the concern and suggest a way forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.14,
      "end": 135.7,
      "text": "This example doesn't match the instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.62,
      "end": 137.2,
      "text": "Could we try another?"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.0,
      "end": 139.56,
      "text": "Back in our original scenario,"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.56,
      "end": 143.6,
      "text": "the group successfully fixes the problem Maya noticed with the history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.68,
      "end": 146.28,
      "text": "The group fixes the problem Maya noticed."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.24,
      "end": 148.44,
      "text": "What could you say to give her credit?"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.58,
      "end": 150.5,
      "text": "AI can write it."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.88,
      "end": 152.52,
      "text": "It can't be the person in the room."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.58,
      "end": 153.82,
      "text": "Listen well."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.74,
      "end": 157.44,
      "text": "Speak clearly, and be someone people want to work with."
    }
  ],
